rs.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>I am NOT running any paid service, any alert service and I don&#8217;t sell anything.<\/strong><br \/>\n<strong>I only want dedicated people wanting to learn to trade.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>If you don&#8217;t follow the rules<\/strong> and if it is obvious you haven&#8217;t read the above posts, <strong>you will be muted\/blocked<\/strong> sooner rather than later.<\/p>\n<p>I want <strong>quality people over quantity<\/strong> in my trading community.<br \/>\nIf you want alerts or entertainment, I&#8217;m sure <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cbsnews.com\/news\/raging-bull-pandemic-stock-tips-accused-137-million-fraud\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">these guys<\/a> are happy to take your money.<\/p>\n<p>Thank you =)<\/p>\n<h3>Contact \/ Follow Me<\/h3>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.twitter.com\/qullamaggie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\n<h4><a href=\"https:\/\/www.twitter.com\/qullamaggie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><br \/>\nTwitter <\/a><\/h4>\n<p>Stock Trading related commentary and thoughts<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/qullamaggie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\n<h4><a href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/qullamaggie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><br \/>\nYouTube <\/a><\/h4>\n<p>Uploading streams here, chat not included<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.twitch.com\/qullamaggie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\n<h4><a href=\"https:\/\/www.twitch.com\/qullamaggie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><br \/>\nTwitch <\/a><\/h4>\n<p>Streaming first 1-2 hours of every trading session.<br \/>\nThe latest streams can be viewed here with the chat included<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/discord.gg\/wKwKd8dEvX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\n<h4><a href=\"https:\/\/discord.gg\/wdrMPESAq4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><br \/>\nDiscord <\/a><\/h4>\n<p>D